# Fleet Management System - Web App Environment Variables Example

# CARTO API Key for basemap tile layer on the Live Fleet Map.
# Set VITE_CARTO_API_KEY in production deployment environment if using keyed Carto endpoints.
VITE_CARTO_API_KEY=

# HTTPS MeshSat map iframe URL for the Live Fleet Map MeshSat tab.
# Must be HTTPS in production to avoid mixed-content iframe blocking on HTTPS sites.
VITE_MESHSAT_MAP_URL=https://meshsat.dspng.space/map
